        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 24 at 4:15AM AKDT until September 25 at 5:00AM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...W wind 25 to 40 kt. Seas 16 to 24 ft. Rain showers.
.TONIGHT...NW wind 25 to 40 kt diminishing to 15 to 30 kt after
midnight. Seas 15 to 23 ft. Rain showers.
.FRI...NW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 10 to 16 ft.
.FRI NIGHT...NW wind 10 to 25 kt. Seas 7 to 11 ft.
.SAT THROUGH MON...W wind 10 to 20 kt. Seas 5 to 10 ft.
</description>
